WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.867
Very significant

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.702
moment on the world stage.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.570
President Biden met

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.170
with Ukrainian

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.572
President Volodymyr Zelensky

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.207
during this unannounced trip.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.408
It comes just days

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.409
before the one year

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:10.710
mark of Russia's

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.445
brutal invasion of Ukraine.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.748
This moment is highly significant.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.082
This morning, Biden

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.717
sending a strong message of support

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.285
to Ukrainians as air raid

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:21.821
sirens wailed across Kiev, underscoring

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.391
the very real risk involved in this trip.

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.766
Both leaders spoke a moment ago

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:35.502
about the weight of this historic moment

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.509
President Biden,

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:45.378
that is so important to signal for us

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:48.615
and all we are all the weeks

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:51.351
or months for confirmation.

00:00:51.351 --> 00:00:52.685
It's good to be back in Kiev.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.188
I was telling you, the president

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:58.491
one of your staff members

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:01.661
on the flight from Washington

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:03.063
to Poland

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.998
to ask me how many times I've been

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:07.967
to Kyiv.

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:08.668
This is my eighth trip.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.172
And much has changed,

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:14.340
much of it back in Beijing,

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.875
but also

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:18.445
Ukrainian people stepped up in a way that

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:22.048
few people ever have in their own defense

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:23.650
and

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.252
have apparently

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:28.388
also embraced the notion of democracy

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:31.057
no longer and discussions about

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.894
whether or not a certain privileged

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.297
people have control

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.701
We have seen in coverage

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:43.236
from all fronts this morning.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:45.271
Phil Mattingly is here with me in Warsaw.

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.873
Clarissa Ward is standing by

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.241
on the ground in Kiev.

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.376
Fred Pleitgen is in Moscow and Kylie

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.378
Atwood is at the State Department.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.481
Of course, this is a historic visit

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.682
by President Biden

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:58.017
is actually his eighth visit to Ukraine.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:00.487
His first, though, since Russia invaded.

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:01.020
It's a visit

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:01.654
that he has said

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.089
he has wanted to make since

00:02:03.089 --> 00:02:04.190
11 months ago.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:05.525
But now, of course,

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.160
President Biden has finally made it

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.162
under a shroud of secrecy.

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.797
Clarissa Ward knows that well.

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.632
She was watching this entire visit happen

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:14.000
before it could actually be reported.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:14.734
Clarissa,

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:15.702
the President Biden

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.604
was there on the ground in Kiev.

00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.973
What could you see from your vantage,

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:20.940
from your vantage

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.544
So, Caitlin, we're now

00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.012
here in the square

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.580
where President Biden was.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.883
He was inside St Michael's Church

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:31.751
just behind me.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.453
And you could hear those air raid

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.821
sirens start wailing.

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:35.622
There was a moment

00:02:35.622 --> 00:02:36.623
where everybody was wondering

00:02:36.623 --> 00:02:37.457
whether he was actually

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:38.992
going to come out of the church.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:39.692
He and President

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.661
Zelensky came out of the church.

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.696
They met up with two soldiers

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:45.498
who were carrying wreaths,

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.066
and then they proceeded

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.469
to kind of march over to this area

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:50.737
where you can see several wreaths.

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:52.205
You can also see a lot

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:53.640
of television cameras.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.040
Of course,

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:54.774
this is

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.843
a huge news story here in Ukraine.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.078
And you can see behind me

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.980
just there next to that reporter,

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.550
this is the US wreath

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:07.053
that was laid as President Zelensky

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:09.422
and President Biden looked on.

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.390
The two leaders

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.892
then embraced the air raid.

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.394
Sirens finally stopped

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.629
wailing and president by

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.932
then got into his motorcade.

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.033
And I should say it was

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:23.002
an extraordinarily huge motorcade.

00:03:23.002 --> 00:03:24.704
This entire

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:26.940
area was completely blocked off

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:29.442
to traffic. The streets were empty.

00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:30.410
Our live shot

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.345
position is up on the balcony

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:34.314
of the hotel behind me.

00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:37.450
And we had multiple visits from soldiers

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.119
who told us under no circumstances

00:03:40.353 --> 00:03:42.222
were we to go out on the balcony.

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:42.956
At one stage,

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:43.456
they came up

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:44.224
even to tell us

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.093
to stand back further from the window.

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:49.229
So there was a lot of security

00:03:49.462 --> 00:03:50.563
that went into this.

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:51.331
This is a trip

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:52.398
that many people have been

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:54.267
waiting a long time for.

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:56.402
And as you heard from President Zelensky

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:58.471
talking about how meaningful

00:03:58.471 --> 00:03:59.339
this was, Caitlin,

00:03:59.339 --> 00:04:01.274
what a strong signal of support.

00:04:01.274 --> 00:04:02.041
And that is something

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:04.244
we're hearing reflected again and again

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:06.045
talking to ordinary Ukrainians.

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:07.780
We needed this right now

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.382
and we greatly appreciate it.

00:04:12.285 --> 00:04:12.518
Yeah.

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:12.952
And there's

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:13.720
actual support

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:14.754
that they are sending as well.

00:04:14.754 --> 00:04:15.054
Of course,

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.356
it was a remarkable moment, though.

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:17.090
Was this President

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:17.890
Biden and president

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.525
as long as they were walking into that

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:20.960
the church I believe that's behind you.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.062
Air raid sirens were actually going off

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:24.330
in Kiev as President

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.100
Biden was on the ground right

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.236
And it's interesting because, you know,

00:04:30.236 --> 00:04:31.604
the expectation had been that

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:32.939
with the president here,

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:34.140
it might be a quiet day.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:34.641
The Russians

00:04:34.641 --> 00:04:35.942
almost certainly already knew

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:36.542
he was here.

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:38.578
They'd be unlikely to do something like,

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:39.512
you know,

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:40.113
extraordinary,

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:41.814
like launching a missile attack

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:42.615
on this city

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:44.284
while the president was here.

00:04:44.284 --> 00:04:46.185
But when we heard those air raid sirens,

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:47.520
the first thing you want to find out

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.956
is what type of threat has been reported.

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:50.723
In this case,

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:53.526
it was MiG activity over Belarus.

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:54.127
That, again,

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:55.795
is something that we have on

00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:57.730
an almost daily basis

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.465
but it does take on

00:04:59.465 --> 00:05:00.333
pretty loaded

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.401
significance

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.602
when you have the president

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:04.170
of the United States

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.472
in a church in the center of town

00:05:06.472 --> 00:05:10.310
still, Miles, away from the next border,

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:11.644
the next border being Poland,

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:12.278
where we presume

00:05:12.278 --> 00:05:14.013
obviously he is on his way to now.

00:05:14.013 --> 00:05:17.717
So it was a definitely a tense moment

00:05:17.717 --> 00:05:19.085
although you didn't see

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:21.688
that necessarily reflected on the ground.

00:05:21.854 --> 00:05:23.690
I will say that when we were watching

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:25.491
the movements of people

00:05:25.491 --> 00:05:27.126
who were accompanying

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.495
President Biden and President Zelensky,

00:05:29.729 --> 00:05:30.863
we're very fast.

00:05:30.863 --> 00:05:32.031
A lot of running.

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:34.200
This whole part of the puzzle

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.702
only took 10 minutes.

00:05:35.702 --> 00:05:37.570
It was 5 minutes in the church

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.871
the air race started

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:40.540
wailing, 5 minutes

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.308
here on the ground, laying the wreath.

00:05:42.308 --> 00:05:44.010
And then very quickly,

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.545
President Biden was gone again.

00:05:48.448 --> 00:05:49.048
Yeah.

00:05:49.048 --> 00:05:49.482
And just

00:05:49.482 --> 00:05:51.551
a very small contingent with him.

00:05:51.551 --> 00:05:51.951
Typically,

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.820
he travels with so many staffers

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:54.654
with him, Clarissa.

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:55.188
But also Phil

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:57.023
Mattingly is live here in Warsaw.

00:05:57.023 --> 00:05:57.857
Where President Biden

00:05:57.857 --> 00:05:58.925
is headed after this.

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:00.059
It was actually what was supposed

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:00.226
to be

00:06:00.226 --> 00:06:02.028
the first stop on his schedule, Phil,

00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:03.096
but of course, the White House

00:06:03.096 --> 00:06:04.430
had this secret trip

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.398
that they had been planning.

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:05.531
You know,

00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:06.799
we had not seen President Biden

00:06:06.799 --> 00:06:08.401
since he was out in Washington

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:09.435
on Saturday night.

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:11.304
And then he reappeared in Kiev

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:13.306
at about 8:00 local this morning.

00:06:13.339 --> 00:06:13.873
What more do you know

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.241
about the planning cell

00:06:15.241 --> 00:06:16.476
that went into

00:06:16.476 --> 00:06:20.146
this secret visit of President Biden's

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:20.880
look?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.515
Then there are a lot of details

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.250
that are still not yet public

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.152
by design, for security reasons.

00:06:26.152 --> 00:06:28.354
But we do know that top Biden advisers

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:29.288
have been talking

00:06:29.288 --> 00:06:30.056
for several months

00:06:30.056 --> 00:06:33.693
about how to best symbolize this moment.

00:06:33.693 --> 00:06:35.395
They really were looking at the one year

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:36.362
anniversary of the one year

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:36.996
commemoration,

00:06:36.996 --> 00:06:37.497
I guess,

00:06:37.563 --> 00:06:38.798
of the Russian invasion

00:06:38.798 --> 00:06:39.932
and wanted to ensure

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.667
that they had maximum impact

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:43.102
in terms of the president's

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:44.537
efforts up to this point,

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:45.671
not just from the U.S.

00:06:45.671 --> 00:06:47.073
support size side,

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:47.774
but the durability

00:06:47.774 --> 00:06:48.941
of the international coalition

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:50.276
they put together in part

00:06:50.276 --> 00:06:51.144
because they knew that

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:52.879
there was no clear endgame coming

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:53.646
any time soon.

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:55.047
That was why they saw this

00:06:55.047 --> 00:06:56.449
as such a significant moment.

00:06:56.449 --> 00:06:58.584
Now, in terms of the trip itself.

00:06:58.584 --> 00:06:59.819
As you noted, the last time we saw

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:01.220
the president was on Saturday night.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.555
He was out to dinner with the first lady.

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:04.290
We did not see him again

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:05.658
until the video that you guys

00:07:05.658 --> 00:07:06.726
have been showing.

00:07:06.726 --> 00:07:08.094
What happened in between

00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:09.028
besides the White House

00:07:09.028 --> 00:07:10.830
putting out a public schedule

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.031
that did not have this trip on it

00:07:12.031 --> 00:07:14.400
whatsoever, was the actual trip

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.835
going underway at 4 a.m.

00:07:15.835 --> 00:07:17.203
around 4:15 a.m.

00:07:17.203 --> 00:07:19.639
on Sunday, Air Force One departed

00:07:19.939 --> 00:07:21.174
Andrews Air Force Base.

00:07:21.174 --> 00:07:22.442
There was no notice.

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:23.676
Reporters that were on the trip

00:07:23.676 --> 00:07:25.411
had to give their devices

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:27.680
to staff before they departed.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:28.214
The next time

00:07:28.214 --> 00:07:29.782
reporters were able to talk,

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:31.050
the pool was able to give

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.452
a timeline was 8 a.m.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:34.187
was when they arrived in this area.

00:07:34.187 --> 00:07:35.321
By eight 30

00:07:35.321 --> 00:07:37.190
he was at the palace to meet

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.324
with President Zelensky,

00:07:38.324 --> 00:07:39.392
the first lady as well.

00:07:39.392 --> 00:07:40.293
He was joined, as you noted,

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:42.795
by just a small contingent of staffers.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:43.496
National Security

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:44.564
Adviser Jake Sullivan,

00:07:44.564 --> 00:07:45.364
Deputy Chief of Staff

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.799
Jen O'Malley, Dillon

00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:47.834
Ambassador Bridget Brandt,

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:50.036
and the deputy ambassador as well

00:07:50.036 --> 00:07:50.903
for their meetings.

00:07:50.903 --> 00:07:51.871
And again, it's important to note

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:52.238
this wasn't

00:07:52.238 --> 00:07:54.240
just a symbolic photo,

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.275
a moment for pictures and cameras.

00:07:56.275 --> 00:07:58.010
They also did have a bilateral sit down

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.145
between the two presidents

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.646
and their top advisers

00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:01.414
to discuss

00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:02.615
kind of the current state of play.

00:08:02.615 --> 00:08:04.350
Also presents Walensky

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:05.485
saying they were discussing

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:06.452
a defense assistance

00:08:06.452 --> 00:08:07.353
of which the president

00:08:07.353 --> 00:08:08.187
and President

00:08:08.187 --> 00:08:08.955
Zelensky and his team

00:08:08.955 --> 00:08:10.556
continue to ask for more

00:08:10.556 --> 00:08:11.791
and faster as U.S.

00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:12.725
officials are quite aware

00:08:12.725 --> 00:08:14.227
of at this point in time.

00:08:14.227 --> 00:08:16.362
But I think more importantly, as you look

00:08:16.362 --> 00:08:16.729
and Kaitlan,

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:17.830
you know this as well as anybody

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:18.731
what the president said

00:08:18.731 --> 00:08:20.366
about the importance of this,

00:08:20.366 --> 00:08:21.767
showing that there is no doubt

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:22.902
that there should be no doubt

00:08:22.902 --> 00:08:24.270
about the U.S.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:24.804
support,

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.272
about the durability of that support

00:08:26.272 --> 00:08:27.039
and about the support

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:27.874
of the Western Alliance

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:29.709
that has been there since day one,

00:08:29.709 --> 00:08:30.743
I think was so critical.

00:08:30.743 --> 00:08:32.445
And then one last thing I would say is,

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:32.612
you know,

00:08:32.612 --> 00:08:33.112
the president

00:08:33.112 --> 00:08:34.080
referencing the phone call

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.047
he had with President

00:08:35.047 --> 00:08:37.016
Hilinski on the night of the invasion,

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:39.118
a moment where even top administration

00:08:39.118 --> 00:08:40.786
officials, top Biden advisers

00:08:40.786 --> 00:08:42.088
weren't sure the president's Lewinsky

00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:43.422
would be president that much longer.

00:08:43.422 --> 00:08:43.689
They weren't

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:45.091
sure he would be standing

00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:46.092
that much longer.

00:08:46.092 --> 00:08:48.261
Now, 361 days later,

00:08:48.494 --> 00:08:49.695
not only is President Zelinsky

00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:50.296
still there,

00:08:50.296 --> 00:08:51.731
not only is he still standing,

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:52.732
the President Biden was

00:08:52.732 --> 00:08:54.000
standing in Kiev with her.

